      "sourceTextSha256": "8833c942df391cb83b564bc9c0256ec0ec9e532252e1cd70b603fc3a40732745",
      "text": "Day 10 · Breakfast and excursion to Corcovado and the statue of Christ the Redeemer, at 710 m: the ascent passes through gardens full of tropical trees to the foot of Rio’s most famous landmark, with an impressive view over the city. Return to the hotel. Optional: a helicopter flight over Rio, and in the evening, we recommend the seafood of the Marius restaurant (see Optional excursions).",
