      "sourceTextSha256": "7e6960ba67adfa1c3339905003297c5457fc020537e909fac540f92f69552405",
      "text": "Day 11 · Breakfast, transfer to Búzios (without a guide) and check-in at the hotel. A former fishing village about 170 km from Rio de Janeiro, Búzios charms with its picturesque landscapes, lush vegetation and scenic beaches of warm golden sand and clear ocean water, framed by forested hills, coastal cliffs and colourful sunsets. The climate is dry and mild, with temperatures generally between 20 and 30 °C.",
